<title>UK: Wet Brent trades weaker, sole date kept.</title>
<headline>Wet Brent trades weaker, sole date kept.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Brent cargo loading Jan 17-19 traded at Feb Brent +16 cents on Monday afternoon, four cents below Friday's last traded levels, dealers said.</p>
<p>The sole Brent date nominated from the paper chains on Monday, loading Jan 21-23, was kept by trader Arcadia, they said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 5387</p>
